<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password on your <%= appName %> account.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0">
  <a href="<%= resetUrl %>"
     style="background:#0b5cab;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block">
    Choose a new password
  </a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280">
  Or paste this into your browser:<br>
  <span style="word-break:break-all"><%= resetUrl %></span>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280">
  The link is valid for one hour and can be used once. If this was not you, nothing has changed and
  you can ignore this email.
</p>
